    "title": "Count Pairs With XOR Equal to K",
    "category": "Hashing",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an integer array and an integer K, determine the number of pairs (i, j) such that i < j and nums[i] XOR nums[j] = K.",
